WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.000
Beiqiang Footwear working-site exterior in Quanzhou, Fujian, China.

00:08.000 --> 00:30.000
Material cutting preparation and cutting equipment in the working area.

00:30.000 --> 00:40.000
Organized component racks before upper-making work.

00:40.000 --> 01:03.000
Stitching stations and footwear-upper construction.

01:03.000 --> 01:25.000
Finished-shoe storage and order-staging areas.

01:25.000 --> 01:40.000
Upper finishing and edge preparation on the last.

01:40.000 --> 02:05.000
Production-line handling, component preparation and pair checking.

02:05.000 --> 02:13.000
Pair wrapping and shoe-box packing preparation.

02:13.000 --> 02:40.000
Line handling and finishing work across multiple stations.

02:40.000 --> 03:00.000
Equipment-assisted finishing and final production-line handling.
